        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I was scheduled an appointment for a full checkup No cleaning  with Dr  Zeinab to my surprise she didn’t do the complete checkup only check one tooth that the filling came out of  and took 2 X-rays for what when I had the Panoramic x-ray. Plus  1 extra  claiming to be able to see the difference between the panoramic one and the regular  X-rays   Lies cause when I asked the dentist she didn’t need the X-rays the dentist said she can see that the front tooth has been filed down you could tell that dentist didn’t want to provide me with service she didn’t even spend 3 minutes in my mouth that’s why I didn’t get the service that I paid for that I was scheduled for\n\nI was so Disturb with the service  and disrespect that I encounter and it didn’t end there  I was  then asked by the assistant if I work  ? and what do I do ?  I didn’t know I was applying for a job at the dentist clinic I had an appointment not a Job interview\nClearly my profession  and the colour of my skin determines the quality of service  that I would  receive  wow we are in 2025 in this day and they didn’t make me feel welcome\n\nI don’t appreciate my time and my money being wasted I addressed the receptionist because I didn’t receive the service that I was scheduled for today. And was  told I would have to schedule a full checkup next time  I have a job I can’t just take off work  for nothing cause you offered  me a service that you didn’t respect and provide me with due to your hatred and Racism for people that look like me with poor service you provide to intentionally Inconvenience me so I wouldn’t want to go back to this dental clinic what a waste of my day off of work to go to a dentist that doesn’t like serving and giving people of colour the same treatment as they would a Caucasian person that was my experience",
        "time": 1737162503,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
