        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I've personally been going here since I was a kid, however I had some time in which I didn't go. But I've recently been back and I can't say enough about Dr. Matthew and his crew!! Excellent and kind people all around. Highly recommend if looking for a new dentist 😊",
